From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 21:49:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(zb_cli): add zb bundle check

Report the Brewfile entries that are not installed and exit non-zero
if there are any, reading only the local database, so an .envrc can run
`zb bundle check || zb bundle install` instead of downloading on every
run.

Closes #376

Assisted-by: Claude Code
