+### Added
+- `zb bundle check` reports the packages in a Brewfile that are not installed and exits non-zero if there are any, without downloading anything, so `zb bundle check || zb bundle install` can run from an `.envrc` like `brew bundle check` ([#376](https://github.com/zerobrewhq/zerobrew/issues/376))
+
 ### Changed
 - The Homebrew tap is `zerobrewhq/tap`: `brew install zerobrewhq/tap/zerobrew`. The repository was renamed from `homebrew-zerobrew`, so taps of `zerobrewhq/zerobrew` and `cachebag/zerobrew` keep updating through GitHub's redirect
 
